<title>FINLAND: SAUNATEC SEES MARKET GROWTH CONTINUING.</title>
<headline>SAUNATEC SEES MARKET GROWTH CONTINUING.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish sauna equipment maker Oy Saunatec Ltd said on Friday it expects demand for sauna equipment to grow further in all its main market areas.</p>
<p>&quot;Demand for sauna and particularly for steam bath equipment appears to be growing further in all the main market areas,&quot; Saunatec said in a statement with its preliminary 1996 report.</p>
</text>
